u-&gt;f : summarize(courseId, materialId, style)
f-&gt;s : summarize(course, material, style)
s-&gt;p : summaryPrompt(style, chunks)
combinedFragment=loop~generation s a; s:[Each batch, at most two generation attempts]
s-&gt;l : generate(prompt)
l-&gt;a : sendRequest(jsonBody)
a.&gt;l : Chat Completions response or error
l.&gt;s : LLMResponse
--
s-&gt;p : mergeSummaryPrompt when several batches are needed
s-&gt;l : generate(merge prompt) when needed
l.&gt;s : merged summary or error
s:Require nonempty usable replies before replacing the summary
s-&gt;r : saveCourse(course)
r.&gt;u : saved summary or explicit failure
s:A failed request keeps the earlier saved summary</panel_attributes>
